        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Array return for pairs — callers rename freely",
            "Object for 3+ values: {data, loading, error}",
            "Hooks compose; calls inline into the caller's list",
            "Extract on duplication, long bodies, or to name an effect"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Do Not Build useMount",
          "text": "A generic useEffectOnce hides deps from the linter and drags lifecycle thinking back. Test real hooks with renderHook from @testing-library/react."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. useState vs useReducer",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Pick",
            "When"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "useState",
              "independent simple values"
            ],
            [
              "useReducer",
              "next state spans fields"
            ],
            [
              "useReducer",
              "many actions, one object"
            ],
            [
              "useReducer",
              "stable `dispatch` as a dep"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. useState vs useRef"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Trait",
            "useState",
            "useRef"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "re-renders",
