        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Ref = remember, but never display",
            "Timer IDs, DOM nodes, prior values, flags"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. useMemo vs useCallback"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "jsx",
          "lines": [
            "useMemo(fn, d)     // caches fn()'s RESULT",
            "useCallback(f, d)  // caches f itself",
            "useCallback(f,d) === useMemo(() => f, d)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Effect Or Handler?"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Happened because a user did it → handler",
            "Must be true for a given render → effect",
            "Async after paint vs sync before paint",
            "Layout effect only to avoid visual flicker"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. useReducer In Practice"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "jsx",
          "lines": [
            "function reduce(s, a){",
            "  if (a.type === 'inc')",
            "    return { ...s, n: s.n + 1 }",
            "  return s }",
            "const [s, dispatch] =",
            "  useReducer(reduce, { n: 0 })"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`dispatch({ type: 'inc' })` from any handler",
            "Reducer is a ==pure function== — test it alone",
            "Actions describe **what** happened, not how"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Refs In Practice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_title": "Custom Hooks (cont.)",
      "blocks": [
