          "type": "code",
          "lang": "jsx",
          "lines": [
            "const idRef = useRef(null)",
            "const start = () => { idRef.current",
            "  = setInterval(tick, 1000) }",
            "const stop = () =>",
            "  clearInterval(idRef.current)"
          ],
          "note": "writing .current never re-renders"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Rendered? State. Not? Ref.",
          "text": "If the value appears in JSX, it is state. If only handlers or effects read it, a ref avoids wasted renders."
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "The mapping is approximate, not exact",
            "One effect can span all three phases",
            "Effects run after paint; didMount ran before"
